# Packages for Subglacial Plume Simulation
# NOTE: SHELFICE disabled for initial plume test
# With grounded ice, SHELFICE blocks west boundary cells,
# conflicting with OBCS conduit injection.
# Re-enable after verifying plume dynamics work.
 &PACKAGES
 usePTRACERS = .TRUE.,
 useOBCS = .TRUE.,
 useSHELFICE = .FALSE.,
 useDIAGNOSTICS = .TRUE.,
 &
